# Pairs with NoLostContribution. Reproduces production before #4613 was fixed
# (#4626): a split does not forward a CRDT write to its destination, and its
# drains import the source's row as a cross-shard migration, which is dropped
# over any destination row not itself migrated and otherwise installed
# last-writer-wins. The destination's own terminal fold is such a row, so the
# split keeps one copy and loses whatever the other alone held.
MODULE: NoLostContributionSplitImportDropsOverOwnRow
TARGET: NoLostContribution
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a split's import drops the source's row over the destination's own fold, losing a contribution only the source held
PERTURBS: WriteB, Copy, Commit

--- FIND
          /\ IF owner = "src" /\ Forwarding
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: a split does not forward a CRDT write.
          /\ IF owner = "src" /\ Forwarding /\ kind = "resize"
--- END

--- FIND
    /\ Import
    /\ pend' = [pend EXCEPT !["dst"] = @ \/ (pend["src"] /\ sg = "prepared")]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: a split's background drain imports last-writer-wins, dropped over an own row.
    /\ IF kind = "split"
       THEN IF stamp["dst"] > 0 /\ ~migd["dst"]
            THEN UNCHANGED <<row, stamp, clk, migd>>
            ELSE IF stamp["src"] > stamp["dst"]
                 THEN /\ row' = [row EXCEPT !["dst"] = row["src"]]
                      /\ stamp' = [stamp EXCEPT !["dst"] = stamp["src"]]
                      /\ clk' = [clk EXCEPT !["dst"] = Max(@, stamp["src"])]
                      /\ migd' = [migd EXCEPT !["dst"] = TRUE]
                 ELSE UNCHANGED <<row, stamp, clk, migd>>
       ELSE Import
    /\ pend' = [pend EXCEPT !["dst"] = @ \/ (pend["src"] /\ sg = "prepared")]
--- END

--- FIND
       THEN Import
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the final drain imports last-writer-wins, dropped over an own row.
       THEN IF stamp["dst"] > 0 /\ ~migd["dst"]
            THEN UNCHANGED <<row, stamp, clk, migd>>
            ELSE IF stamp["src"] > stamp["dst"]
                 THEN /\ row' = [row EXCEPT !["dst"] = row["src"]]
                      /\ stamp' = [stamp EXCEPT !["dst"] = stamp["src"]]
                      /\ clk' = [clk EXCEPT !["dst"] = Max(@, stamp["src"])]
                      /\ migd' = [migd EXCEPT !["dst"] = TRUE]
                 ELSE UNCHANGED <<row, stamp, clk, migd>>
--- END